{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 17, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL CONCERNS REGARDING ITS VALIDITY AND IMPLICATIONS. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE ARGUED THAT THIS SENTENCE ENCOURAGES CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE AND PROMOTES A LACK OF RESPECT FOR THE RULE OF LAW. BY SUGGESTING THAT INDIVIDUALS SHOULD NOT FOLLOW LAWS THEY DEEM BAD, THIS SENTENCE CAN BE SEEN AS UNDERMINING THE AUTHORITY OF GOVERNMENTS AND THE LEGAL SYSTEM AS A WHOLE. FURTHERMORE, IT DOES NOT PROVIDE ANY CLEAR GUIDELINES OR CRITERIA FOR DETERMINING WHAT CONSTITUTES A \"BAD\" LAW, LEAVING IT TO INDIVIDUAL INTERPRETATION AND POTENTIALLY LEADING TO CHAOS AND ANARCHY.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nON THE OTHER HAND, THE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" CAN ALSO BE VIEWED AS A CALL TO ACTION FOR INDIVIDUALS TO STAND UP AGAINST UNJUST OR OPPRESSIVE LAWS. THROUGHOUT HISTORY, CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE HAS BEEN A POWERFUL TOOL FOR BRINGING ABOUT SOCIAL CHANGE AND CHALLENGING UNFAIR LAWS. HOWEVER, THIS SENTENCE NEEDS TO BE QUALIFIED AND NUIANCED IN ORDER TO BE EFFECTIVE AND RESPONSIBLE. IT SHOULD BE ACCOMPANIED BY A CLEAR UNDERSTANDING OF THE CONSEQUENCES OF DISOBEYING THE LAW, AS WELL AS A COMMITMENT TO WORKING WITHIN THE SYSTEM TO BRING ABOUT CHANGE. WITHOUT SUCH QUALIFICATIONS, THE SENTENCE REMAINS A SIMPLISTIC AND POTENTIALLY DANGEROUS STATEMENT THAT CAN BE MISUSED AND MISINTERPRETED.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -4.577531944960356e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -2.3007127310847864e-05}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.0009129646932706237}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.202602356672287}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.001329015358351171}, {"toke